# Your rule content

*   Never commit sensitive information like API keys to the repository; use `.env` files and add them to `.gitignore`.
*   if files and components are close to 1000 lines, suggest refactoring 
*   when encountering errors do the following: Reflect on 5-7 different possible source of the problem, distill those down to 1-2 most likely sources, and the add logs to validate your assumptions before we move onto the implementing the actual code fix
